				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Line height</td>
					<td>1</td>
					<td>Literal in .btn</td>
					<td>Private candidate</td>
					<td>
						Propose button-owned --_line-height: 1 for single-line label
						composition. It need not become a global typography rule; revisit if
						shared across controls.
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Outline shell thickness</td>
					<td>2px</td>
					<td>--button-border-width</td>
					<td>Shared foundation + private alias</td>
					<td>
						Keep the visible 2px border weight as a shared decision (proposed
