					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Corner radius</td>
					<td>2px</td>
					<td>--button-border-radius → --radius-sm</td>
					<td>Backed → private alias</td>
					<td>
						Propose --_radius: var(--radius-sm) on .btn; no new public radius
